  "$comment": "Stage 06 normalisation goldens. Hand-written postings in the shapes real sources produce (a careers page, two aggregators, a board), with the canonical fields each MUST yield. A change in any expected value is a behaviour change to be reviewed, not a fixture to be regenerated.",
